WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.031 --> 00:00:03.614
(bell tolling)

00:00:04.505 --> 00:00:06.037
- I don't think there is a contradiction

00:00:06.037 --> 00:00:09.287
between a simple life and a spicy food.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:16.922
Perhaps someone who's living a simple life

00:00:16.922 --> 00:00:20.231
needs to have something to spice it up.

00:00:20.231 --> 00:00:23.983
Maybe that works (laughs).

00:00:23.983 --> 00:00:27.233
(peaceful piano music)

00:00:31.219 --> 00:00:33.222
My name is Father Richard Walz,

00:00:33.222 --> 00:00:35.765
and I am a monk of Subiaco Abbey,

00:00:35.765 --> 00:00:39.265
which is a monastery in Subiaco, Arkansas.

00:00:41.128 --> 00:00:42.626
After I graduated from high school,

00:00:42.626 --> 00:00:44.626
I entered the monastery,

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:48.162
so I've been 55 years a monk.

00:00:49.406 --> 00:00:51.906
(men singing)

00:00:56.337 --> 00:01:00.621
Monk sauce, which we produce
here at Subiaco Abbey,

00:01:00.621 --> 00:01:03.042
is an habanero pepper sauce.

00:01:03.042 --> 00:01:06.891
We call that Monk Sauce,
because it's monk-made.

00:01:06.891 --> 00:01:09.015
Anybody who has handled habanero peppers

00:01:09.015 --> 00:01:11.018
knows that you should not be doing this

00:01:11.018 --> 00:01:12.601
without a glove on.

00:01:14.362 --> 00:01:18.529
A good monk is a good balance
between prayer and work.

00:01:20.875 --> 00:01:23.792
(blender whirring)

00:01:24.811 --> 00:01:26.622
That oughta be done.

00:01:26.622 --> 00:01:29.289
Wanna find out if it's any good?

00:01:30.296 --> 00:01:34.379
Where's the water, huh (laughs)?

00:01:38.795 --> 00:01:40.763
I suspect that a lot of people

00:01:40.763 --> 00:01:44.834
have kind of fanciful ideas
about monks and what they do,

00:01:44.834 --> 00:01:48.518
and they get into the
monastery and they find out

00:01:48.518 --> 00:01:52.268
that monks are very much
like everybody else.

00:01:55.906 --> 00:01:58.406
(engine hums)

00:02:01.167 --> 00:02:05.334
I feel very close connection
to the land in this area.

00:02:08.585 --> 00:02:10.292
The longer that I was here,

00:02:10.292 --> 00:02:13.584
the more I realized that God got me here

00:02:13.584 --> 00:02:17.380
because he knew I ought
to be in a community.

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:20.961
The community is a very
important thing to me.

00:02:20.961 --> 00:02:24.211
(peaceful piano music)

